      "writtenOn": "2026-11-17T15:35:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These vectors follow from the removed label stack, see LUNlriParser.java#111.\nPer RFC 8277 sec. 2.2/2.4 the serialized NLRI must keep the label (0x800000\nfor withdraw empty label), so the expected bytes should stay as before.",
      "revId": "105ca50e837fbda0a122fc560803c827b8f01722",
